d professional communication.\nOverall, I judged that Candidate\u202fB\u2019s operational reliability, stress resilience, technical aptitude, and decision\u2011making strengths outweigh the noted concerns, provided that the memory and interpersonal issues can be addressed through training and monitoring."}
