{"id": 57, "ts": 1780425228.225887, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 3, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I hear James and Emily emphasizing Candidate\u202fB\u2019s strong reliability and stress handling, but both also flag serious crew\u2011interaction concerns\u2014nasty remarks, pretentious tone, and potential erosion of professional communication. For a long\u2011distance pilot, consistent crew cooperation is as vital as technical reliability. Candidate\u202fC, on the other hand, is noted as\u202f100\u202f% reliable and explicitly creates a positive atmosphere with his crew, which directly supports the cooperation and morale needed on extended flights. Although C has difficulty communicating ideas and is seen as egocentric, his proven reliability and the positive crew environment outweigh those drawbacks, especially compared with B\u2019s documented interpersonal issues. Therefore, I shift my provisional recommendation to **Candidate\u202fC** as the better overall fit."}
